data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","toolCallId":"call_104adc19d849411d8cb4b487","messageId":"7b780be2-6635-4bfb-a9ff-5a925eabb20c","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"status\":\"available\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"creatorVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"versions\":{\"@za38.03/agent-ui-core\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-renderer\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-runtime\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-web-component\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-creator\":\"0.0.1\"},\"sourceDigest\":\"373e8784ed400aa3d4982d94a83cffc45fb4fede729b539cc5b62ef39947bfd9\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-ag-ui-events\",\"title\":\"5. 检查结果\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/custom-ag-ui-events.md\",\"summary\":\"按步骤将自定义 CUSTOM 事件解析并显示为消息卡片。\",\"sha256\":\"29f23a159ddd3b0f79b1b0668e0270d52473e07b81a5196504ef6a85adfe708b\",\"sectionId\":\"s157\",\"offset\":0,\"totalCharacters\":187,\"content\":\"## 5. 检查结果\\n\\n运行项目已有的类型检查和构建，再让 Agent 返回第 1 步的事件。会话中应显示：\\n\\n```text\\n工单摘要\\nT-1042：无法登录工作台\\n```\\n\\n再检查一次缺少字段的数据是否显示错误提示，以及中英文切换是否生效。\\n\\n需要让其他插件订阅实时业务通知时，见[订阅业务事件](/development/plugin-api.md#订阅业务事件)。\\n\",\"nextOffset\":null}}","role":"tool"}

