ontrols to the conversation composer.\",\"capabilities\":[\"conversation-composer-submit-action\"],\"selected\":true,\"selectionOwner\":\"composition\",\"requiredServices\":{\"names\":[],\"status\":\"not-required\",\"missing\":[]},\"optionalServices\":{\"names\":[\"agent-ui.locale\"],\"available\":[\"agent-ui.locale\"]},\"childSlots\":{}},{\"pluginId\":\"task-group\",\"name\":\"Task Group\",\"description\":\"Renders nested agent work as expandable task cards.\",\"capabilities\":[\"conversation-task-group-renderer\"],\"selected\":false,\"selectionOwner\":\"composition\",\"requiredServices\":{\"names\":[],\"status\":\"not-required\",\"missing\":[]},\"optionalServices\":{\"names\":[],\"available\":[]},\"childSlots\":{}},{\"pluginId\":\"test-notice\",\"name\":\"Test Notice\",\"description\":\"Displays a static bilingual notice at the top of the chat area using React native elements and theme tokens.\",\"capabilities\":[\"test-notice\"],\"selected\":true,\"selectionOwner\":\"composition\",\"requiredServices\":{\"names\":[],\"status\":\"not-required\",\"missing\":[]},\"optionalServices\":{\"names\":[\"agent-ui.locale\"],\"available\":[\"agent-ui.locale\"]},\"childSlots\":{}},{\"pluginId\":\"theme-provider\",\"componentPresentation\":{\"packageVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"module\":\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins/theme-provider\",\"component\":\"ThemeProviderPlugin\",\"facts\":{\"presentation\":\"The built-in theme keys are light, dark and violet; the default is violet. A custom brand color such as blue is a project CSS palette customization, not a new theme enum value. ThemeProviderPlugin renders its children and does not accept palette/color props.\",\"composition\":\"Keep the existing theme service and AgentUIRoot. Agent theme props or createAgentUIThemeService(initialTheme) select a built-in preset; AppUIModel does not configure component props. Do not add another theme Runtime or edit npm implementation files.\",\"styles\":\"Import @za38.03/agent-ui-plugins/styles.css before project overrides. Scoped palette selectors are :is(.agent-ui-root, .agent-ui-conversation)[data-theme=\\\"violet\\\"] for the default preset. Override --agent-brand and --agent-brand-solid for the brand and solid actions; --primary, --ring, --sidebar-primary and --sidebar-ring are semantic control/sidebar colors. Violet derives --primary and sidebar/focus colors from --agent-brand-solid; neutral light/dark derive --agent-brand from --primary, so override both when customizing those presets. Other public tokens include --background, --foreground, --card, --muted, --border, --input, --primary-foreground, --sidebar and --sidebar-foreground. Keep surfaces/readability coherent and verify rendered colors and theme switching. These names describe this installed package; project CSS overrides need no source takeover.\"}},\"name\":\"Headless Theme Service Provider\",\"description\":\"Provides the shared Agent UI theme preset service to other UI plugins.\",\"capabilities\":[\"headless\",\"plugin-service-provider\",\"theme\"],\"selected\":true,\"selectionOwner\":\"composition\",\"requiredServices\":{\"names\":[],\"status\":\"not-required\",\"missing\":[]},\"optionalServices\":{\"names\":[],\"available\":[]},\"childSlots\":{}},{\"pluginId\":\"theme-switch\",\"name\":\"Theme Switch\",\"description\":\"Calls the shared theme service exposed by another UI plugin.\",\"capabilities\":[\"plugin-service-consumer\",\"theme-control\"],\"selected\":true,\"selectionOwner\":\"composition\",\"requiredServices\":{\"names\":[\"agent-ui.theme\"],\"status\":\"resolved\",\"missing\":[]},\"optionalServices\":{\"names\":[\"agent-ui.locale\"],\"available\":[\"agent-ui.locale\"]},\"childSlots\":{}},{\"pluginId\":\"thinking-indicator\",\"name\":\"Conversation Thinking Indicator\",\"description\":\"Message-scoped live status placeholder. Yields to visible reasoning or tool activity; does not disable the separate reasoning renderer.\",\"capabilities\":[\"conversation-thinking-indicator-renderer\"],\"selec